Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Resolve SHPinDllOfCLSID providers from the active SxS context.
 Use Wine's current COM-redirection record with bounds checks, then resolve
 the DLL through its owning activation context. Keep registry fallback only
 for CLSIDs absent from SxS.
